{
  "ledger": [
    "foreground woman | walking toward camera, right hand contacts red fruit, left hand grips open blue umbrella | facing away from camera, left hand grips umbrella (red fruit held in left hand, obscured), right hand rests on umbrella handle | continuous forward walking motion, transfers red fruit from bimanual hold to left-hand-only hold, turns 180 degrees leftward while walking, maintains foot-ground contact throughout",
    "red fruit | held between right and left hands at chest height | held in left hand (obscured by umbrella/body) | contact maintained continuously, right hand releases contact ~6-7s, no loss of support",
    "blue umbrella | gripped in left hand, open above head | gripped in left hand, open above head | grip maintained throughout, position shifts with woman's movement, no release",
    "background pedestrians | walking in opposite direction to foreground woman | pass by foreground woman and recede | all maintain foot-ground contact, natural walking kinematics, no clipping with other people or stalls",
    "market produce stalls | line both sides of walkway, stationary relative to ground | pass by foreground woman via camera motion | no contact with foreground woman, no object clipping between stall items"
  ],
  "findings": []
}
